B.ad_=new A.fb("1. Scope",'These Terms of Service govern your use of the Cercle application and membership, operated by Cercle, Vienna, Austria ("Cercle", "we"). By creating an account you accept these terms and our Privacy Policy.')
B.adm=new A.fb("2. Membership","Membership is by application and is granted at our discretion. We may suspend or terminate a membership for a breach of these terms, conduct that endangers other members, or a failure to pay applicable fees. You may end your membership at any time by deleting your account; paid periods already started are non-refundable unless required by law.")
B.adj=new A.fb("3. Code of conduct","Members treat each other with respect. Harassment, discrimination, threats, deceptive profiles, and non-consensual sharing of another member's information or images are prohibited. Each mode (Dating / Sport / Social) has an intent \u2014 represent yourself honestly and use each context as intended. Repeatedly not showing up to plans or events you confirmed may lead to suspension.")
B.ad1=new A.fb("4. Content","You keep the rights to content you post and grant Cercle a licence to host and display it within the service. You are responsible for your content and must have the right to share it.")
B.acY=new A.fb("5. Payments","Membership tiers and event fees are shown in the app. Prices include Austrian VAT where applicable. Subscriptions renew until cancelled.")
B.ad9=new A.fb("6. Disclaimer & liability","Cercle facilitates introductions and plans between members; we do not vet members beyond the application review and do not supervise meetings. To the extent permitted by law, Cercle is not liable for the conduct of members or for indirect or consequential damages. Nothing limits liability for intent or gross negligence, or for injury to life, body or health.")
